            "A) Design the referral reward program that incentivizes existing users to invite colleagues and peers",
            "D) Track the viral coefficient metric and report it to the product team for implementation in the product roadmap planning process",
            "C) Create the landing page experience that converts viral referral traffic at higher rates than cold acquisition traffic",
