            "A) Organizational structures in PLG companies typically place customer success and sales under CMO leadership for integrated revenue ownership",
            "C) Full-funnel accountability is required by PLG framework standards that growth-stage investors use to evaluate CMO scope and compensation",
            "D) PLG metrics require cohort analysis across the full user journey that only the CMO has the analytical resources to produce accurately"
